Package: miaHIDpordo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @GTK@, @GLIB@, shared-mime-info
Maintainer: Bir <bir@localhost>
Description: MiaHIDPordo - GTK3 HIDl port monitor and terminal
 MiaHIDPordo opens a HIDl port (ttyS*, ttyUSB*, ttyACM*...),
 shows received data as text or hex dump with selectable line
 endings, highlights control characters (\n, \r ...), can send
 data and reconnect automatically at startup.
 .
 Settings are persisted with libconfig to ~/.config/miaHIDpordo.cfg.
